	"data": "At will agreement\n\nATTACHMENT 4\nINFOSYS LIMITED\nAT-WILL EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT\nI understand and acknowledge that my employment with Infosys is “at-will.” This means that either\nInfosys or I may terminate my employment at any time, with or without cause, and with or without notice. It\nalso means that my job duties, title, responsibilities, reporting level, compensation and benefits, as well as\nInfosys's personnel policies and procedures, may be changed at any time. The “at-will” nature of…",
